^rukx  "šdeχd keθəɢð" — welcome, world.
^rukx  An exclamatory sentence (!) speaks its phrase aloud.
!"šdeχd-keθəɢð".

^rukx  xe = indicative marker. "5 x put" — objects first, verb last (SOV).
^xe-5-x-ţə''.

^rukx  Numbers are hexadecimal: 0a is ten, 10 is sixteen.
!"x:",x,"x+10:",x-10-babg.

^rukx  'u = past tense: it already happened, so pi is fixed (constant).
^'u-"jnaķm"-sodrm-ţə''.
!sodrm.
